              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Did you get my photo? Splendid! What? Yes, the Malughast turns invisible! Don't be obtuse. Now, there, you see that? Of course you don't.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Doctor_Witch_LM-NIGHT_013.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520138,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But what we have here is a map of sort of the Malughast's spirit - likes, dislikes, and what releases it. Just need a concoction of let's see...",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Doctor_Witch_LM-NIGHT_014.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520138,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Some of this, little of this. *Sniff Sniff* None of those. Definitely one of these and that should be that. Solomon, hold out your sword.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Doctor_Witch_LM-NIGHT_015.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520138,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "There. With that, you can release the Malughast's spirit to enter the next realm. I'll send you my bill. Well, bills. Be seated when reading them.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_B_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Doctor_Witch_LM-NIGHT_016.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520138,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC05_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Then we've but one task, Wizard. Confront Hierarch Lucien. When the master is imperiled, the dog will rush to his aid.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Solomon_Crane_LM-NIGHT_075.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520136,
